bb420d0d (479 1793240973311 "guenchi" (("4gm4c2jr" . 3240) ("w5vbequy" . 14982)) (put ((kind . section) (title . "landing f363") (src . "test: eval-local binds the no-area row's runs before its probes\n\nThe row that checks a writer with no draft area put its two eval runs\nand its two file-exists? probes in one list application. The order in\nwhich an application's operands are evaluated is unspecified, so the\nprobes could look before either run and read #f on a product that\ncreates the area: the row could not fail. The runs are now bound in the\nlet* before the probes, with a comment saying why. Measured on a product\nthat still creates the area: the edited row reads red, the probes-first\nvariant reads green.\n\n- test/eval-local.sc: the runs bound before the probes.\n- test/rows-baseline.txt: eval-local's hash (rows and lines unchanged).\n") (parent . root) (ord . 493))))
