e3ff9415 (491 1793242641119 "guenchi" (("4gm4c2jr" . 3240) ("w5vbequy" . 14982)) (put ((kind . section) (title . "landing f369") (src . "test: eval-local binds the slot row's run before its pool probe\n\nThe row that checks a run root with no admission pool put the eval run\nand the probe for the pool's first slot in one list application. The\norder in which an application's operands are evaluated is unspecified,\nso the probe could look before the run made the pool and read #f: a\nfalse red on a correct product. The run is now bound in an inner let,\nafter the row's fresh run root and its pre-made structural area and\nbefore the probe, with a comment saying why. Measured: the probe-first\nvariant reads #f against the expected #t, the run's answer unchanged.\n\n- test/eval-local.sc: the run bound before the probe.\n- test/rows-baseline.txt: eval-local's hash (rows and lines unchanged).\n") (parent . root) (ord . 495))))
